    "vs_reference_arm": "the reference arm is the untouched host; this candidate adds one term whose gradient reaches the codebook without pulling a transition's two codewords together"
  },
  "equation": "\u4ee4 p_j(x) = softmax_j(-||x-codebook_j||_2^2 / temperature)\uff0c\u4ee4 s_i = \u03a3_j p_j(source_i) codebook_j\u3001t_i = \u03a3_j p_j(target_i) codebook_j\u3002\u5b9a\u4e49 L = weight * mean_i(mask_i * [||s_i-target_i||_2^2 - ||t_i-source_i||_2^2 + separation_weight * relu(margin - ||s_i-t_i||_2)^2])\u3002\u524d\u4e24\u9879\u6784\u6210\u6709\u5411\u5206\u914d\u76ee\u6807\uff0c\u672b\u9879\u60e9\u7f5a\u6765\u6e90\u548c\u76ee\u6807\u8f6f\u5206\u914d\u7801\u5411\u91cf\u8fc7\u8fd1\u3002",
